     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Use the negative exponent rule. <span data-math=\"{a^{ - n}} = \\frac{1}{{{a^n}}}\"></span> provided that <i>a</i> ≠ 0.</p>\n<p>The negative exponent rule lets you say <span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{{{2^9}}}\"></span> is equal to <span data-math=\"{2^{ - 9}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{{c^5}}}{{{2^9}}} = {c^5} \\times {2^{ - 9}}\"></span></p>"
